# Regression-test engine: 13 kN sea-level LOX/RP-1, non-scalar (station-wise)
# regen wall sizing, machined pintle STEP, and pump CAD package.
#
# Run from the repository root with:
#   PYTHONPATH=. python -m raosim @examples/cli/test_13kn_sealevel_regen_allstl.args
# (or `lrekit @examples/cli/test_13kn_sealevel_regen_allstl.args` when installed)
#
# This file is the full benchmark package. Any later command-line flag
# overrides the value here; append `--max-nfev 0 --out builds/tests/13kn_sl_fast`
# only when you intentionally want a quick seed-geometry smoke run.
#
# Parameter provenance (see TEST_PROMPT.md and docs/REPO_PHYSICS_AUDIT_2026-07-02.md):
#   - LOX/RP-1 gamma/Mw/Tc/O-F from the built-in table anchored to Sutton &
#     Biblarz RPE 9th ed. Table 5-5 (raosim/propellants.py source note).
#   - Pc = 3.0 MPa: verified feasible for the station-wise GRCop-84 regen
#     sizing at this thrust class; Bartz throat heat flux scales ~Pc^0.8
#     (Bartz 1957, propulsion_texts/technical-notes-1957.pdf), and 7 MPa was
#     probed thermally infeasible for every catalog liner at 13 kN.
#   - Sea-level matched expansion Pe = Pa = 101325 Pa (optimum CF when
#     Pe = Pa, Sutton RPE; repo relation expansion_ratio_from_pressure):
#     epsilon = 4.524, pa/p0 = 101325/3.0e6 = 0.033775.
#   - GRCop-84 liner + Inconel 718 closeout per NASA GRCop chamber work
#     (propulsion_texts/gradl2016..2020.pdf); catalog T_max 1000 K, S_y 186 MPa.
#   - SP-125 station-wise liner stress screens (eqs 4-28/29/31/32, audited
#     2026-07-02).
#   - Upstream throat radius Ru = 1.5 Rt explicitly (--ru-factor 1.5): the
#     SP-8120 throat-approach radius-ratio upper bound (0.6-1.5, verbatim;
#     SP8120_UPSTREAM_RADIUS_RATIO_BOUNDS in raosim/throat_geometry.py) and
#     the standard Rao/Sutton bell convention Ru = 1.5 Rt
#     (propulsion_texts/nozzle_geometries.pdf, audited 2026-07-02).  The
#     implied Hall inviscid Cd at gamma = 1.24 is 0.98963.  The file
#     previously requested --cd-target 0.99, which inverts to Ru/Rt = 1.5275
#     — outside the strict SP-8120 range now enforced — and aborted at
#     argument validation (evaluation 2026-07-13, FINDING 1).

--no-banner

# Operating point: 13 kN at sea level, matched expansion.
--propellant LOX/RP-1
--oxidizer LOX
--fuel RP-1
--pc 3.0e6
--target-thrust 13000
--epsilon 4.524
--pa-over-p0 0.033775
--length-pct 80

# Chamber and throat package.
--l-star 1.0
--contraction-ratio 3.0
--minimum-cylindrical-length 0.03
--ru-factor 1.5

# Full JAX Rao/MOC solve budget and default benchmark resolution. This is
# intentionally host-scale; use a command-line override for quick smoke checks.
--max-nfev 4000
--n-control 24
--n-kernel 24

# Non-scalar regen: station-wise hot-wall + channel thermostructural sizing
# (SP-125 screens), GRCop-84 liner with Inconel 718 closeout jacket.
--regen
--wall-sizing regen
--material grcop-84
--jacket-material inconel718
--channel-height 0.0025
--channel-height-steps 6
--helix-turns 1.0
--coolant rp1
--coolant-inlet-temperature 293
--cooling-fraction 1.0
--margin-target 1.05
--structural-fos 1.0
--required-cycles 25
--life-fos 1.0
--dp-budget 500
--t-hot-min 0.0006
--t-hot-max 0.003
--thermal

# Pintle injector and electric pump feed package.
--injector pintle
--pintle-radial-stream fuel
--pintle-radial-exit holes
--pintle-slot-count 24
--pintle-target-momentum-ratio 0.52
--electric-pump
--fuel-tank-pressure 500000
--oxidizer-tank-pressure 600000
# Feed ledger availability for the 13 kN, Pc=3 MPa sea-level point.
# Fast-probe cycle flow is ~1.595 kg/s RP-1 and ~3.620 kg/s LOX; capacities
# below carry ~20% margin. Required outlet pressure is ~42.8 bar fuel
# including regen and ~37.2 bar LOX before the control margin, so the supply
# pressures retain several bar of positive feed_pump_pressure margin.
--fuel-supply-pressure 5000000
--oxidizer-supply-pressure 4500000
--fuel-flow-capacity 1.95
--oxidizer-flow-capacity 4.40
--fuel-npsh-required 100000
--oxidizer-npsh-required 100000
--fuel-injector-dp-fraction 0.20
--oxidizer-injector-dp-fraction 0.20
--fuel-line-loss-fraction 0.02
--oxidizer-line-loss-fraction 0.02
--fuel-manifold-loss-fraction 0.02
--oxidizer-manifold-loss-fraction 0.02
--fuel-control-margin-fraction 0.05
--oxidizer-control-margin-fraction 0.05
--throttle-map 0.5,0.75,1.0
--pump-max-rpm 120000
--burn-time 12

# CAD package: wall.stl / jacket.stl / regen.stl are always written. Pintle
# machined mode writes the Nardi/TRW coaxial five-part stack
# (pintle_body, pintle_tip, injector_body, orifice_plate, faceplate) plus
# injector_assembly_machined.step when CadQuery/OpenCascade is installed.
# Pump format `both` = fast prism envelope meshes (pump_parts/) PLUS the true
# CadQuery B-rep parts (pump_brep/, STEP + STL per part): meridional
# hub/backplate revolve, log-spiral camber blades from the solved beta1/beta2
# (pumps.impeller_blade_camber; SP-8109), helical constant-lead inducer
# (SP-8052 sec.3.1.10), diffuser vanes at the solved flow angle, volute
# scroll. Plain `stl` would ship only the placeholder prisms.
--injector-cad machined
--injector-cad-format step
--pump-cad parts
--pump-cad-format both

# Full-feature coverage (2026-07-13): exercise every co-runnable exporter and
# renderer in one benchmark pass.
#   --cad step          chamber/nozzle wall STEP B-rep with the flange/bolt
#                       interface features (export.py; CadQuery required)
#   --regen-brep        full-N one-solid regen wall STEP; --regen-manifolds
#                       adds the inlet/outlet manifold bodies and ports
#   --engine-assembly   assemble wall/jacket/pintle/pump STEP into the
#                       engine_cad assembly (requires --cad step)
#   --pump-visualize    pump_particles.gif for the sized electric pumps
# NOT co-runnable in this file (kept as separate checks):
#   - movable-pintle architecture: examples/cli/test_13kn_movable_pintle.args
#     (--injector-architecture son_continuous_movable conflicts with the
#     fixed machined coaxial CAD benchmarked here)
#   - MOC flow-field render + Rao/BDE construction diagrams + crossing CSV:
#     examples/cli/test_13kn_rao_bvp_flowfield.args (--flowfield requires
#     --contour-method rao-bvp; this benchmark's authoritative export
#     contour is the Bezier/TOP-chart path)
#   - OpenFOAM spray-case export: `python -m raosim export-openfoam-spray ...`
#     (separate subcommand, consumes a finished run directory)
#   - spray<->performance coupling: opt-in fixed point, blocked with --regen
#     at the CLI by design (one-way solver, docs/SPRAY_CSTAR_COUPLING.md)
#   - --animate march/particles GIFs: minutes of render time, cosmetic only
--cad step
--regen-brep
--regen-manifolds
--engine-assembly
--pump-visualize

--out builds/tests/13kn_sl_full
